				<div class='Ctitle'><nobr>경애하는</nobr> <nobr><span style="font-size:110%;font-weight:bold;">김정은</span>동지</nobr>께서 신년경축행사에 참가한 해외작전부대 지휘관가족들을 만나시고 기념사진을 찍으시였다				<a href="../../photoview/ikn260101014/ko "  >
				   				   <i class="fa fa-camera" style="font-size:24px;color:#ae0101;padding-left:10px"></i>
									 </a>
				</div>					
				<div class="detail-content-body" style="width:100%;">	
					<div class="content-wrapper">					
					
							
					<div align=center  style="margin-bottom:20px">
